    monster in your GY; Special Summon this card, and if you do, Special Summon that
    monster, but negate its effects, also you cannot Special Summon from the Extra
    Deck for the rest of this turn, except Synchro Monsters. You can banish this
    card from your GY; this turn, no "Junk Warrior" you control can be destroyed
    by your opponent''s card effects.'
